{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adventure awaits in Wake World an open-ocean action RPG.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/9bf1b67fc97d714b58ca5c4055bbccdc.poster.avif?t=1760736300\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/9bf1b67fc97d714b58ca5c4055bbccdc.webm?t=1760736300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/9bf1b67fc97d714b58ca5c4055bbccdc.mp4?t=1760736300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail alone or with friends through a strange, decaying world. Battle bizarre creatures, brave shifting weather, and complete unique challenges across a chain of mysterious islands. Whether you're chasing the six lost artifacts or just soaking in the world, every step forward uncovers something new.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake World can be played as a coop multiplayer game, allowing players to join forces with others and embark on the adventure together. Play with friends or join a random group and work together to explore. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/ce1945babbd03613530ba552de4bc455.poster.avif?t=1760736300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/ce1945babbd03613530ba552de4bc455.webm?t=1760736300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/ce1945babbd03613530ba552de4bc455.mp4?t=1760736300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Ship Is Your Home</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Steamship is not just a means of transportation, it's your home and base of operations. As you explore the world of Wake World, you will rely on your ship to traverse the ocean, discover new islands and face off against the dangers that lurk in the waters. As the seas become more hostiles you can fully customize and upgrade it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic hand to rock physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No game should launch into early access without it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/741494fefb3854ff9326513578b6538d.poster.avif?t=1760736300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/741494fefb3854ff9326513578b6538d.webm?t=1760736300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/extras/741494fefb3854ff9326513578b6538d.mp4?t=1760736300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1877250?t=1760736300","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1877250?t=1760736300","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/213b88d4332797e07b2690a06b40403d6dafe008/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760736300","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877250/213b88d4332797e07b2690a06b40403d6dafe008/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760736300","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co